msgstr "Terapkan"

msgid "NEW SCHEDULED CHANGE"
msgstr "PERUBAHAN TERJADWAL BARU"

msgid "Automatically apply a profile at a given time every day — for example, dim the screen at night."
msgstr "Terapkan profil secara otomatis pada waktu tertentu setiap hari — misalnya, meredupkan layar di malam hari."

msgid "Add"
msgstr "Tambah"

msgid "Apply the most recent entry at startup"
msgstr "Terapkan entri terbaru saat startup"

msgid "Useful if the computer was off at the scheduled time."
msgstr "Berguna jika komputer mati pada waktu yang dijadwalkan."

