msgstr "PINTASAN GLOBAL"

msgid "Click a field and press the keys. Backspace clears it, Esc cancels."
msgstr "Klik kolom lalu tekan tombol. Backspace menghapus, Esc membatalkan."

msgid "ABOUT"
msgstr "TENTANG"

msgid "A modern DDC/CI monitor controller, rewritten in Rust and Slint. Inspired by ClickMonitorDDC."
msgstr "Pengontrol monitor DDC/CI modern, ditulis ulang dengan Rust dan Slint. Terinspirasi dari ClickMonitorDDC."

